# COMMUNICATION WORKSPACE RULE

Canonical: `docs/modules/CHAT_WORKSPACE.md`

1. ONE entry: `/seo/{connection_hash}/chat`
2. Exactly 3 modes: Agent | Group Chat | Support Ticket
3. Mode switch = round launcher (`.seo-global-chat__launcher`) — no horizontal tabs
4. Legacy `/agent` = redirect only (`tab=agent` + preserve deep links)
5. Group chat = JS client + JSON API; no Livewire poll/render
6. Outside Chat: light round launcher + unread-count only (~30s, single-inflight)
7. Group poll ≥ 15s default; single-inflight scheduler
8. Support tickets offline-safe (local MySQL first); attach via `TeamChatAttachmentService`
9. No Telegram/Zalo/WebSocket/generic messaging framework
10. Reuse Chat Workspace — never add a parallel chat popup/page (`ChatModeV2`, etc.)
